node_modules/

# Reproducible heavy media — NOT committed to git (too large; regenerable).
# Footage: run `bash scripts/fetch-footage.sh` (licensed Mixkit clips, see
#   public/footage/SOURCES.md).
# Voice-over: run `bash scripts/generate-vo.sh` (edge-tts, see AUDIO.md).
# Music: run `bash scripts/fetch-music.sh` (licensed Mixkit, see
#   public/audio/music/SOURCES.md).
# Rendered master: run `npm run render:film`.
public/footage/*.mp4
public/footage/_contact/
public/audio/vo/*.mp3
public/audio/vo/*.vtt
public/audio/music/*.mp3
out/*.mp4
out/frames/

# Keep in git (lightweight proof + reproducibility):
#   scripts/*, public/**/SOURCES.md, public/audio/vo/measured-durations.json,
#   out/film-stills/*.png, out/*.md
!out/film-stills/
